OL,3,GNEWSALong delays as stretch of M60
OL,4,Aclosed during police incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M60 has been closed
OL,7,Fdue to a police incident.
OL,9,FDrivers were warned to expect delays of
OL,10,Fmore than 30 minutes after a stretch of
OL,11,Fthe motorway was shut in both
OL,12,Fdirections between Junction 17 at
OL,13,FPrestwich and Junction 18 at Simister
OL,14,FIsland, National Highways said.
OL,16,FGreater Manchester Police were at the
OL,17,Fscene alongside North West Ambulance
OL,18,FService and fire crews, it added.
OL,20,FThree miles (4.8km) of congestion was
OL,21,Freported on the approach to the
OL,22,Fclosure.
